++# Task 3: Inline Tier-2 Packages
++
++## Scope
++Inline **6 tier-2 core packages** that depend on already-inlined packages:
++
++1. `rules-engine` (~3.1k LOC, 44 files) ├ö├ç├Â depends on utils
++2. `comment-checker-core` (~498 LOC, 5 files) ├ö├ç├Â depends on utils
++3. `telemetry-core` (~977 LOC, 12 files) ├ö├ç├Â depends on utils
++4. `delegate-core` (~400 LOC, 6 files) ├ö├ç├Â depends on model-core
++5. `prompts-core` (~653 LOC, 14 files) ├ö├ç├Â depends on model-core, utils
++6. `agents-md-core` (~278 LOC, 9 files) ├ö├ç├Â depends on rules-engine
++
++## Steps
++
++### Step 1: Copy source trees + fix internal imports
++For each package, copy `packages/{name}/src/*` to `src/shared/{name}/`, then fix `@oh-my-opencode/` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/` within all `src/shared/{name}/` files.
++
++Use a script or function to avoid repetition:
++```pwsh
++$tier2 = @('rules-engine','comment-checker-core','telemetry-core','delegate-core','prompts-core','agents-md-core')
++foreach ($pkg in $tier2) {
++    Copy-Item -Recurse "packages/$pkg/src/*" "src/shared/$pkg/"
++}
++```
++
++Then within `src/shared/*/`, bulk-replace `@oh-my-opencode/` with `#shared/`.
++
++### Step 2: Fix omo-opencode imports
++In `packages/omo-opencode/src/`, bulk-replace each old workspace package reference:
++- `@oh-my-opencode/rules-engine` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/rules-engine` (~19 files)
++- `@oh-my-opencode/comment-checker-core` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/comment-checker-core` (~3 files)
++- `@oh-my-opencode/telemetry-core` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/telemetry-core` (~6 files)
++- `@oh-my-opencode/delegate-core` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/delegate-core` (~4 files)
++- `@oh-my-opencode/prompts-core` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/prompts-core` (~9 files)
++- `@oh-my-opencode/agents-md-core` ├ö├Ñ├å `#shared/agents-md-core` (~3 files)
++
++### Step 3: Verify
++```bash
++tsgo --noEmit
++```
++Must be zero errors on `src/shared/**/*`. Vendored MCP builds should still work.
++
++### Step 4: Commit
++```bash
++git add -A && git commit -m "phase2(task3): inline tier-2 packages"
++```
++
++## Global Constraints
++- `#shared/{name}` ├ö├Ñ├å `src/shared/{name}/index.ts` path alias already in tsconfig
++- Restore original `package.json` for each inlined package (revert the re-export shim from Task 1)
++- Vendored MCPs don't reference these packages, so no vendored dep updates needed
++- Each `src/shared/{name}/` needs a minimal `package.json` (`{ "type": "module", "name": "@oh-my-opencode/{name}", "main": "index.ts" }`) for `file:` dep compatibility
++- Keep original source at `packages/{name}/src/` for now (don't delete ├ö├ç├Â will be removed in Task 5)
