++#### A. Automated Verification
++1. `lsp_diagnostics` on the project ├ö├Ñ├å ZERO errors (directory scans are capped at 50 files; not a full-project guarantee).
++2. Build command from the plan's "Success Criteria" section ├ö├Ñ├å exit code 0. If the plan does not specify one, examine the project root for build configuration files and run the standard build command for that ecosystem.
